<view class="page"><view class="eyebrow">TRAVEL BUDDIES</view><view class="title" style="font-size:48rpx;margin-top:8rpx">一起出发，<br/>让旅途多一个故事。</view><view class="tabs"><view wx:for="{{tabs}}" wx:key="*this" class="tab {{tab===item?'selected':''}}" data-tab="{{item}}" bindtap="choose">{{item}}</view></view><view class="card match-card"><view class="section-title" style="font-size:28rpx">匹配你的旅伴</view><view class="muted" style="margin:8rpx 0 20rpx">只展示与你有共同计划的人，申请每日最多 3 次。</view><view class="grid-2"><input class="input" placeholder="年龄" data-key="age" bindinput="input"/><input class="input" placeholder="预算 ¥" data-key="budget" value="{{budget}}" bindinput="input"/><input class="input" placeholder="出发日期"/><input class="input" placeholder="兴趣，如摄影" data-key="interest" value="{{interest}}" bindinput="input"/></view></view><view class="section-head"><view class="section-title">为你推荐</view><view class="muted">{{profiles.length}} 位旅友</view></view><view class="card buddy" wx:for="{{profiles}}" wx:key="name"><image class="avatar" src="{{item.image}}"/><view class="buddy-main"><view class="row"><view style="font-size:30rpx;font-weight:700">{{item.name}} <text class="muted">{{item.age}} · {{item.city}}</text></view><text style="color:#d17d57;font-weight:700">{{item.match}}</text></view><view class="muted" style="margin-top:8rpx">共同兴趣：{{item.tag}}</view><button class="outline small" data-name="{{item.name}}" bindtap="apply">申请同行</button></view></view></view>
